    <published>2026-09-08T17:30:00.000Z</published>
    <summary>学校高性能计算平台的 SLURM 实测：机器构成与代际、分区参数对照（CPU 型号/核数/内存/加速卡）、作业提交与内存记账的坑、23P 存储的挂载类型与 inode 规模、环境与启动速度优化。</summary>
    <title>学校 HPC 集群</title>
    <updated>2026-09-16T08:10:00.000Z</updated>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <author>
      <name>陈鑫宇</name>
    </author>
    <category term="量化" scheme="https://4choor3.github.io/categories/%E9%87%8F%E5%8C%96/"/>
    <category term="量化" scheme="https://4choor3.github.io/tags/%E9%87%8F%E5%8C%96/"/>
    <category term="baostock" scheme="https://4choor3.github.io/tags/baostock/"/>
    <category term="数据管道" scheme="https://4choor3.github.io/tags/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%AE%A1%E9%81%93/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>回测和信号依赖一份稳定的本地行情。公开数据接口大多限频，盘中临时拉一段历史要等，多次拉取的结果也不一致，所以这份数据落在自己手里：约 7315 支标的、1990 年至今的前复权 A 股日线，数据源 baostock。</p><h2 id="数据落地"><a href="#数据落地" class="headerlink" title="数据落地"></a>数据落地</h2><p>字段是 date&#x2F;open&#x2F;high&#x2F;low&#x2F;close&#x2F;volume。前复权保证历史价格连续可比，跨年份拼接不会出现除权造成的断点。文件按代码命名，一个标的一个 CSV，存于 HPC 的 <code>stock_data_qfq/</code> 目录，共 7000 多个文件。</p><p>生成环境是 Python 3.12，pandas 做清洗和拼接，回测接 backtrader 与 vectorbt。数据源选 baostock 的原因：免费、接口稳定、支持前复权。</p><h2 id="更新机制"><a href="#更新机制" class="headerlink" title="更新机制"></a>更新机制</h2><p>更新走两条链路，各解决一类问题：</p><ul><li>每天 22:00 由 cron 触发增量，只补最近缺失的交易日；</li><li>每 7 天做一次全量覆盖，把 1990 年至今重新拉一遍，纠正增量过程中累积的复权误差和漏点。</li></ul><p>增量靠「上一次最后交易日的后一天」续接，中断重启不会重拉全历史；两种模式写同一个目录，按文件名对齐。</p><p>下面是单只标的的可运行版本，依赖 baostock 和 pandas，装完直接跑就能拉到数据。正式版把 code 换成 7315 支的循环，其余不用动；传 <code>last_date=None</code> 或删掉本地 CSV 就走全量。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> sys</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> datetime <span class="keyword">import</span> date, timedelta</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> pathlib <span class="keyword">import</span> Path</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> baostock <span class="keyword">as</span> bs</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> pandas <span class="keyword">as</span> pd</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">FIELDS = <span class="string">&quot;date,open,high,low,close,volume&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">fetch</span>(<span class="params">code, last_date=<span class="literal">None</span></span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> date.today().weekday() &gt;= <span class="number">5</span>:                  <span class="comment"># 周末休市，不请求</span></span><br><span class="line">        sys.exit(<span class="number">0</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    end = date.today().isoformat()</span><br><span class="line">    start = <span class="string">&quot;1990-01-01&quot;</span> <span class="keyword">if</span> last_date <span class="keyword">is</span> <span class="literal">None</span> <span class="keyword">else</span> (</span><br><span class="line">        date.fromisoformat(last_date) + timedelta(days=<span class="number">1</span>)).isoformat()</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> start &gt; end:                                  <span class="comment"># 已是最新，不请求</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> pd.DataFrame(columns=FIELDS.split(<span class="string">&quot;,&quot;</span>))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    lg = bs.login()</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> lg.error_code != <span class="string">&quot;0&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        sys.exit(<span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    rs = bs.query_history_k_data_plus(</span><br><span class="line">        code, FIELDS,</span><br><span class="line">        start_date=start, end_date=end,</span><br><span class="line">        frequency=<span class="string">&quot;d&quot;</span>, adjustflag=<span class="string">&quot;2&quot;</span>,               <span class="comment"># 日线、前复权</span></span><br><span class="line">    )</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> rs.error_code != <span class="string">&quot;0&quot;</span>:                         <span class="comment"># 失败非零退出，不静默</span></span><br><span class="line">        sys.exit(<span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    fields = rs.fields</span><br><span class="line">    rows = []</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> rs.<span class="built_in">next</span>():</span><br><span class="line">        rows.append(rs.get_row_data())</span><br><span class="line">    bs.logout()</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> pd.DataFrame(rows, columns=fields)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> __name__ == <span class="string">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    path = Path(<span class="string">&quot;stock_data_qfq/sh.600000.csv&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    old = pd.read_csv(path, dtype=<span class="built_in">str</span>) <span class="keyword">if</span> path.exists() <span class="keyword">else</span> pd.DataFrame()</span><br><span class="line">    new = fetch(<span class="string">&quot;sh.600000&quot;</span>, old[<span class="string">&quot;date&quot;</span>].<span class="built_in">max</span>() <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="built_in">len</span>(old) <span class="keyword">else</span> <span class="literal">None</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    merged = pd.concat([old, new]).drop_duplicates(subset=<span class="string">&quot;date&quot;</span>, keep=<span class="string">&quot;last&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    merged = merged.sort_values(<span class="string">&quot;date&quot;</span>).reset_index(drop=<span class="literal">True</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    path.parent.mkdir(parents=<span class="literal">True</span>, exist_ok=<span class="literal">True</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    merged.to_csv(path, index=<span class="literal">False</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;<span class="subst">&#123;path&#125;</span>: 新增 <span class="subst">&#123;<span class="built_in">len</span>(new)&#125;</span> 行，共 <span class="subst">&#123;<span class="built_in">len</span>(merged)&#125;</span> 行&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这段代码运行过：sh.600000 拉到 6508 行（1999-11-10 至 2026-09-15），文件 516K；紧接着再跑一次，输出「新增 0 行，共 6508 行」，落盘前按 date 去重，不会重复写入。</p><h2 id="跑起来之后修过的三个问题"><a href="#跑起来之后修过的三个问题" class="headerlink" title="跑起来之后修过的三个问题"></a>跑起来之后修过的三个问题</h2><p><strong>起点差一天</strong>。增量起点用了 last_date 本身，而不是它的后一天，最后一根 K 线每天被重复写一遍，拼接后索引重复。这个问题没有报错，靠下游对账发现：画图时最新收盘价与前一天的记录对不上。修复是起点显式加一天，落盘前按日期去重。</p><p><strong>异常被吞掉</strong>。baostock 偶发超时，最初的 try&#x2F;except 把异常吃掉，脚本以 0 退出，日志没有异常痕迹，数据断更没人知道。修复分两步：失败路径一律 exit(1)；脚本末尾加自检，把应更新的标的数和实际写入数比对，不一致就告警。</p><p><strong>空返回当「已最新」</strong>。周末 cron 照常触发，baostock 返回空 DataFrame，旧逻辑把「空」当成「已最新」提前返回，下一个交易日反而缺数。修复是两步判断：非交易日先短路退出，空返回不落盘。</p><p>这三种情况各需要一条明确分支：异常、空返回、非交易日都不能走正常路径退出，正常退出码只代表数据真的写进去了。</p><h2 id="日常维护"><a href="#日常维护" class="headerlink" title="日常维护"></a>日常维护</h2><p>数据更新是全自动的：cron 每天拉增量、每周做全量，出问题靠末尾自检的告警发现。维护工作集中在脚本本身：补数据源缺失的标的、调整自检和重试逻辑。</p><p>这部分现在交给 agent：需求和边界写清楚，初版由它产出，后续改动也由它执行。管道是例外——挂 cron 之前主逻辑要自己过一遍，agent 的说明写得再顺，也要对着代码确认。一次性的杂务（批量改名、从 PDF 抽表、定位报错）不专门写脚本，直接交给 agent 跑完。</p><p>集群上的重算与回测：长任务用 tmux 保活，断网不影响；批量计算写成脚本用 sbatch 提交 SLURM。</p><h2 id="策略面"><a href="#策略面" class="headerlink" title="策略面"></a>策略面</h2><p>信号以 MACD、KDJ、筹码分布为主，偶尔打板。持仓周期 7–14 天，交易频繁，对滑点和手续费敏感，回测里先把成本模型固定下来，再调信号。backtrader 承载策略逻辑，vectorbt 做参数扫描。</p>]]>
